91	     * When the customer code is absent it falls back to resolving the region directly, preferring the
92	     * postcode range (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099) and then the fixed city-to-region
93	     * table ({@code Sydney -> NSW}, {@code Melbourne -> VIC}, {@code Brisbane -> QLD}), yielding
94	     * {@code "UNKNOWN"} when neither resolves.
